            "review_title": "Review at Roadway Cafe & Beer",
            "review_text": "honzajavorek\nPrague, Czech Republic2 contributions\n0\nWe spent most of our HCMC time here :D\nApr 2018 • Couples\nThe owner of this cafe/bar also offers accommodation, so we ended up visiting it because of that. It was close by our room, Thong is a nice person, and you can get good drinks here - so the cafe/bar quickly became our base in HCMC, safe harbor from where we started our days and where we ended them. We even brought our friends here. The Phan Van Han street is full of local houses, local shops, and amazing local street food. The HCMC city center is for regular tourists - spend your time on this local street and you won’t regret it. We traveled many places in Vietnam after HCMC, but nowhere we got so good (and cheap!) draft beer as at Roadway!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 30, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
